    <briefdescription>
<para>This class is a wrapper over an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_a_a_results" kindref="compound">AAResults</ref>, and it is intended to be used only when there are no IR changes inbetween queries. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_batch_a_a_results" kindref="compound">BatchAAResults</ref> is reusing the same <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_a_a_query_info" kindref="compound">AAQueryInfo</ref></computeroutput> to preserve the state across queries, esentially making <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_a_a" kindref="compound">AA</ref> work in &quot;batch mode&quot;. The internal state cannot be cleared, so to go &quot;out-of-batch-mode&quot;, the user must either use <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_a_a_results" kindref="compound">AAResults</ref>, or create a new <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_batch_a_a_results" kindref="compound">BatchAAResults</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
